## About this machine

<!-- Copy to worker1.md (the machine's key in MACHINES) and write what an agent should know about this one
     machine: what else runs here, what it is good for, what it is not for. -->
- This is a shared machine: the game's build runners use it too, so keep heavy jobs to two at a time.
- A full copy of the game's files is at `/srv/game`; models and textures read from there.
